sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as search-service
    participant OS as OpenSearch
    B->>S: GET /search?q=trail&brand=Acme&sort=price_asc&limit=20
    S->>OS: bool(must: multi_match, filter: ACTIVE, has productId) · post_filter brand · aggs brand, category · size 21
    OS-->>S: 21 hits, facets
    S-->>B: 20 items, facets, total, nextCursor = sort values of item 20
    B->>S: GET /search?…&cursor=…
    S->>OS: same query + search_after [price, sku]
